      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING GRESSIER (2) was a last start winner (22.86) from Box 2 at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Expected to be right there at the finish again. FASCINATE GLORY (1) generally breaks well and with clear running can clear the draw. Latest effort finished 2nd on September 11 over 400m at this track behind Paper Shredder beaten 4.5 lengths (23.29) in a Mix 1/2/3. Looks suited here and can measure up. FASCINATE VERN (8) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, rewarded with a win last time at this track over 400m. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Should be in this for a long way. DAPHNE ZACAPA (7) gets a chance to improve on an unplaced run at her latest outing at this circuit.",
